WEBVTT

00:16.800 --> 00:19.000
DARK ABYSS, LAVA EXECUTION GROUND

00:22.880 --> 00:24.680
Why haven't you given up yet?

00:24.760 --> 00:28.160
-You humans…
-The Five Sects of the Immortal Alliance,

00:28.240 --> 00:30.320
-You wish to repair the cracks.
-claim to be the beacon of righteousness,

00:30.400 --> 00:31.440
-are nothing but cowards
-You…

00:31.520 --> 00:33.760
-hiding behind the Immortals Array.
-How pathetic!

00:33.840 --> 00:34.920
Cowards!

00:35.000 --> 00:36.920
They're merely using you.

00:38.000 --> 00:39.720
You cultivators of the Immortal Alliance.

00:39.800 --> 00:41.480
-I know what you are afraid of.
-No matter how strong your spirits are,

00:41.560 --> 00:42.880
you are still human.

00:42.960 --> 00:44.840
-And all humans face death eventually.
-Because we are the same.

00:44.920 --> 00:46.400
Only we of the Dark Clan

00:46.480 --> 00:48.480
-are immortal and undying,
-The barrier of the Immortals Array

00:48.560 --> 00:50.200
-existing eternally in this world!
-protects the world.

00:50.280 --> 00:53.040
This is the second time
it has shown cracks.

00:53.120 --> 00:55.160
-The true tragedy of the Immortals Array…
-Humans are fragile.

00:55.240 --> 00:56.600
Their hundred-year lives
as fleeting as morning dew.

00:56.680 --> 00:58.440
-They're arrogant and hypocritical.
-…is caused by humans.

00:58.520 --> 01:00.200
Why bother with their fate?

01:00.280 --> 01:01.360
XIE XUECHEN, YOUNG LORD OF SNOW CITY

01:01.440 --> 01:03.000
Join the Dark Abyss!

01:03.080 --> 01:04.800
We don't care about your past.

01:04.879 --> 01:06.440
Here, strength rules.

01:06.520 --> 01:08.600
This is where you truly belong!

01:19.080 --> 01:20.040
Jun Tian!

01:23.920 --> 01:24.880
Attack!

01:47.480 --> 01:50.360
SANG QI, LORD OF THE DARK ABYSS

02:45.960 --> 02:48.400
So, this is the Young Lord of Snow City,

02:48.480 --> 02:49.720
Xie Xuechen.

03:03.560 --> 03:04.960
This Lava Execution Ground

03:05.040 --> 03:07.640
is where the fallen gods
was buried 10,000 years ago.

03:08.240 --> 03:10.840
Every hour, the wrath
of the ancient gods bursts forth here,

03:11.880 --> 03:12.960
scorching your soul

03:13.560 --> 03:14.640
and piercing your bones.

03:15.480 --> 03:17.680
It stands alongside
the Divine Execution Platform

03:17.760 --> 03:20.000
as one of the two
most terrifying places in the world.

03:21.880 --> 03:24.280
No one has ever survived here
for three days.

03:24.960 --> 03:26.200
And yet,

03:26.280 --> 03:28.000
you've endured for seven.

03:28.800 --> 03:32.240
You truly live up to your reputation
as the Chosen of Heaven,

03:32.320 --> 03:34.200
the strongest sword cultivator.

03:35.800 --> 03:38.880
MU XUANLING, SAINTESS OF THE DARK ABYSS

03:56.400 --> 03:58.480
Young Lord, your features

03:58.560 --> 04:00.280
are unparalleled in this world,

04:00.360 --> 04:01.640
leaving a lasting impression.

04:03.520 --> 04:05.320
Have we met before?

04:33.160 --> 04:34.880
I heard you endured
seven days of punishment

04:34.960 --> 04:36.840
without yielding even a bit.

04:37.720 --> 04:39.480
Your resolve is incredibly firm.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.040
So firm,

04:42.640 --> 04:44.400
yet your lips seem rather soft.

04:50.080 --> 04:51.120
What a pity

04:51.200 --> 04:53.360
you exhausted all your spiritual power

04:53.440 --> 04:54.720
to repair the Immortals Array.

04:55.280 --> 04:58.040
Now you can't even break Sang Qi's seal.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.600
Look at you.

05:01.680 --> 05:04.680
For the sake of humanity,
you even forsake your own life.

05:05.280 --> 05:06.160
Is it really worth it?

05:16.360 --> 05:18.360
A man this handsome…

05:18.440 --> 05:20.000
What a waste if he were to die.

05:20.080 --> 05:20.920
Yes, Saintess.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.640
If he's willing to join us,

05:22.720 --> 05:24.120
we'll clean him up thoroughly

05:24.200 --> 05:25.440
and present him to you!

06:54.200 --> 06:56.960
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

07:00.040 --> 07:02.640
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

07:12.200 --> 07:13.040
Your Grace,

07:13.120 --> 07:14.520
an envoy from the Decaying
Immortal Pavilion requests an audience!

07:15.520 --> 07:18.480
Your master is in such a hurry

07:19.080 --> 07:21.400
that he sends you to me

07:21.480 --> 07:22.800
while I am in seclusion.

07:35.960 --> 07:37.920
Your Grace, your power is extraordinary.

07:38.000 --> 07:39.560
Even while recovering in seclusion,

07:39.640 --> 07:41.840
you can send forth
a projection clone to meet me.

07:41.920 --> 07:44.720
Could it be that this ally of mine

07:44.800 --> 07:46.360
seeks to use this opportunity

07:46.440 --> 07:48.320
to probe into my current state?

07:49.240 --> 07:50.600
Your Grace, you overthink it.

07:51.400 --> 07:53.040
My Master sent me

07:53.120 --> 07:55.760
only to inquire
about the progress of the matter

07:55.840 --> 07:57.160
entrusted to you earlier.

07:57.880 --> 08:00.640
Xie Xuechen has been trapped
in the Lava for seven days,

08:00.720 --> 08:03.880
but his faith remains unbroken.

08:03.960 --> 08:05.680
No one has survived
three days in the Lava,

08:06.920 --> 08:09.040
but Xie Xuechen
holds the key to the Chaos Pearl.

08:09.840 --> 08:10.680
He must not die.

08:12.160 --> 08:13.240
You humans

08:13.320 --> 08:15.640
are always so impatient.

08:16.800 --> 08:18.520
Your Grace, do not forget.

08:18.600 --> 08:20.440
If the Chaos Pearl isn't obtained,

08:20.520 --> 08:22.720
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
will not risk helping you

08:22.800 --> 08:24.760
break the barrier of the Immortals Array.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.080
As long as the barrier exists,

08:27.600 --> 08:29.760
the Dark Clan can never cross

08:29.840 --> 08:31.720
the Two Realms Mountain
to step into the human world!

08:38.120 --> 08:39.840
Go back and tell your master,

08:40.600 --> 08:42.720
since I have already
agreed to this matter,

08:42.799 --> 08:44.400
I have my arrangements.

08:45.440 --> 08:47.680
Do not interfere further.

08:48.520 --> 08:52.360
And now, it's time for you
to show your sincerity.

09:08.960 --> 09:11.000
The Illusion Elixir is a rare treasure,

09:11.080 --> 09:12.200
almost nonexistent in this world.

09:12.720 --> 09:15.240
It helps high-ranking members of
the Dark Clan cultivate projection clones.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.600
Though the true form
cannot cross the Immortals Array,

09:18.200 --> 09:20.280
the projection
can pass through the barrier

09:20.360 --> 09:21.600
and reach the human realm.

09:32.960 --> 09:33.960
A human?

09:35.600 --> 09:37.080
Master, you once said

09:37.160 --> 09:38.400
humans are deceitful,

09:38.920 --> 09:39.960
and the Immortal Alliance
is even more despicable.

09:40.760 --> 09:43.440
Years ago, you fell into their trap

09:43.520 --> 09:45.360
because you trusted the Immortal Alliance,

09:45.880 --> 09:47.120
losing your right arm.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.680
You hate humans,

09:48.760 --> 09:49.920
you despise the Immortal Alliance,

09:50.000 --> 09:51.840
and your lifelong wish
is to invade the human realm.

09:52.440 --> 09:54.920
I always thought
you kept me out of your plans

09:55.000 --> 09:56.760
because of my impulsive nature.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.600
But now, I see,

09:59.360 --> 10:02.840
you would rather work
with those humans you despise the most

10:02.920 --> 10:05.080
than let your disciple help you.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.680
So, in your eyes,

10:07.760 --> 10:09.600
I am less than human.

10:13.400 --> 10:15.040
Do you know who he is?

10:15.120 --> 10:16.800
Someone from the Immortal Alliance.

10:16.880 --> 10:18.280
How can you tell?

10:19.120 --> 10:21.640
Because I know what you want.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.640
There is an item in the human realm

10:24.720 --> 10:26.760
that requires their cooperation to obtain.

10:27.400 --> 10:28.640
It is…

10:29.160 --> 10:31.960
the ancient artifact, the Chaos Pearl.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.720
Legend has it that in ancient times,

10:34.800 --> 10:35.960
the world was in chaos.

10:36.040 --> 10:37.400
Then Heaven and Earth split apart,

10:37.480 --> 10:39.000
forming the three realms.

10:39.080 --> 10:41.320
But the chaotic energy did not disappear.

10:41.400 --> 10:43.400
Instead, it condensed into two artifacts.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.080
The Book of Fate

10:45.160 --> 10:46.560
and the Chaos Pearl.

10:46.640 --> 10:47.800
They are interdependent yet opposing,

10:47.880 --> 10:49.800
maintaining the balance
of destiny together.

10:49.880 --> 10:51.040
Ten thousand years ago,

10:51.120 --> 10:54.000
the Chaos Pearl fell to the mortal world
due to an ancient conflict.

10:54.080 --> 10:56.400
Thousands of years later,
it was discovered by humans.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.680
Humans established the Immortal Alliance,

10:57.760 --> 10:59.240
using the power of the Chaos Pearl

10:59.320 --> 11:01.080
to create the barrier
of the Immortals Array,

11:01.160 --> 11:03.480
trapping the Dark Clan
within the Dark Abyss,

11:03.560 --> 11:05.000
unable to take even a single step out.

11:05.080 --> 11:06.880
The Chaos Pearl
is an ancient divine treasure,

11:06.960 --> 11:08.520
holding the power of chaos.

11:08.600 --> 11:10.840
The five sects
of the Immortal Alliance guard it closely.

11:10.920 --> 11:12.320
Now,

11:12.400 --> 11:14.640
it is stored
in the Pearl Tower of Snow City.

11:15.240 --> 11:18.360
To unlock the Pearl Tower, the tokens
of the five sect leaders are required.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.720
You imprisoned Xie Xuechen.

11:20.400 --> 11:23.120
Wasn't it to force him to reveal
the location of the tokens

11:23.720 --> 11:25.720
and open the tower to retrieve the pearl?

11:25.800 --> 11:26.640
You're smart.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.160
But you've only guessed half of it.

11:29.760 --> 11:31.760
Someone else desires the Chaos Pearl.

11:32.440 --> 11:34.840
Since both sides
have something the other wants,

11:35.480 --> 11:37.840
it's only natural to exploit that.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.200
When you visited Xie Xuechen,

11:43.400 --> 11:44.840
what were you trying to gain?

11:44.920 --> 11:46.920
When I visited Xie Xuechen,

11:47.440 --> 11:50.240
it was, of course, to find out
the location of the tokens

11:50.320 --> 11:51.760
and relieve you of this burden.

11:51.840 --> 11:53.560
So, you're saying

11:53.640 --> 11:56.520
you were gravely injured
while hunting Xie Xuechen

11:56.600 --> 11:57.800
that day.

11:58.320 --> 11:59.160
Have you recovered?

12:03.000 --> 12:04.440
Why are you suddenly

12:04.520 --> 12:06.280
concerned about me?

12:08.080 --> 12:09.800
Your kindness in raising me

12:09.880 --> 12:11.120
is never forgotten.

12:11.200 --> 12:13.280
I've always been thinking

12:13.360 --> 12:15.120
of how to repay you.

12:50.120 --> 12:52.160
You haven't done
anything unnecessary, have you?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.160
Of course not.

12:57.840 --> 13:00.160
Your Grace, Xie Xuechen is attacking here!

13:02.320 --> 13:03.200
No need for you to act.

13:03.280 --> 13:05.200
Focus on your recovery in seclusion.

13:05.280 --> 13:06.160
I'll handle him.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.280
Go ahead.

13:29.480 --> 13:30.640
Jun Tian!

13:44.640 --> 13:45.880
Where is Sang Qi?

13:59.720 --> 14:01.240
It seems we are fated,

14:01.320 --> 14:02.560
meeting again so soon.

14:02.640 --> 14:03.960
It's you.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.080
I'm Mu Xuanling,
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

14:06.160 --> 14:07.400
Young Lord,

14:08.120 --> 14:09.040
please guide me well.

15:04.400 --> 15:06.600
Young Lord…

15:22.280 --> 15:23.600
Are you looking for me?

15:27.000 --> 15:29.280
Why are you in such a hurry, Young Lord?

15:29.360 --> 15:31.120
Could it be that you can't forget

15:31.720 --> 15:32.680
that kiss in the Lava?

15:37.200 --> 15:39.880
You really have no sense
of cherishing beauty, do you?

16:47.320 --> 16:48.680
You shouldn't be here.

16:52.000 --> 16:55.160
If you don't leave,
your spiritual power will run out.

17:06.200 --> 17:08.440
This move seems to resonate with me.

17:09.440 --> 17:12.319
Then, Mr. Xie, why not take me hostage
and escape together?

17:26.680 --> 17:28.359
They say

17:28.440 --> 17:29.880
one day as a couple
means a lifetime of gratitude.

17:30.840 --> 17:33.040
Since I kissed you once,

17:33.120 --> 17:34.240
shouldn't that count

17:35.040 --> 17:37.200
for at least ten days of gratitude?

17:37.720 --> 17:39.120
Young Lord,

17:39.200 --> 17:40.760
you show no mercy at all?

17:48.200 --> 17:49.880
What did you feed me in the Lava?

17:50.560 --> 17:52.480
Why do you treat me as an enemy?

17:53.080 --> 17:54.040
To save you,

17:54.800 --> 17:56.720
I even sacrificed my innocence.

18:00.800 --> 18:02.240
At the time, there were enforcers
from the Dark Abyss present.

18:02.840 --> 18:04.280
I couldn't explain it to you.

18:05.360 --> 18:06.680
The medicine I fed you

18:06.760 --> 18:08.480
is called Half-Day Glory.

18:09.120 --> 18:10.240
After taking it,

18:10.320 --> 18:12.280
you can quickly regain your full strength.

18:13.240 --> 18:16.760
But it requires a very minor price.

18:17.360 --> 18:19.600
-What price?
-The effects only last an hour.

18:20.200 --> 18:22.560
And now, it's probably at its limit.

18:23.280 --> 18:24.120
Moreover,

18:26.400 --> 18:27.960
from this moment on,

18:28.640 --> 18:29.680
for the next ten days,

18:30.480 --> 18:32.880
you'll be completely powerless.

18:33.760 --> 18:35.720
Xie Xuechen!

18:42.560 --> 18:43.800
Xie Xuechen,

18:44.920 --> 18:47.200
now I can finally kill you myself.

18:51.120 --> 18:52.840
Anger Demon, stand down.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.600
But…

18:54.680 --> 18:56.600
But I really want to kill Xie Xuechen!

19:02.360 --> 19:03.760
But I've been taken hostage.

19:04.520 --> 19:05.640
He'll kill me!

19:05.720 --> 19:06.720
So?

19:09.400 --> 19:10.440
Kill!

19:41.000 --> 19:44.480
Mr. Xie, you can't just use me
and abandon me.

19:45.280 --> 19:46.880
-How did you--
-When you weren't there,

19:46.960 --> 19:48.560
Anger Demon lost his will to fight.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.880
He became easy to deal with.

19:51.120 --> 19:54.520
But aren't you curious

19:54.600 --> 19:56.240
how I escaped from the Array?

20:02.840 --> 20:04.240
In the Lava,

20:04.800 --> 20:06.160
I realized you weren't from the Dark Clan.

20:07.080 --> 20:08.800
The Dark Clan has no heartbeat,

20:08.880 --> 20:10.240
but you do.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.000
You and Sang Qi

20:12.640 --> 20:13.480
are both of the Spirit Clan.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.760
As expected of someone
born with an extra sense,

20:19.080 --> 20:20.400
your perception

20:20.480 --> 20:22.120
is extraordinary!

20:27.840 --> 20:29.480
But as the Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

20:30.160 --> 20:31.240
you've also…

20:32.480 --> 20:33.320
committed countless crimes…

20:36.160 --> 20:37.720
Xie Xuechen! Xie Xuechen!

20:40.840 --> 20:42.200
If you're going to faint,
don't do it here.

20:42.960 --> 20:44.400
What if the bad guys catch up?

20:44.920 --> 20:46.120
-Xie Xuechen!
-Bad guys?

20:46.200 --> 20:47.080
Xie Xuechen!

20:47.160 --> 20:48.840
-You've got the nerve to call others bad?
-Xie Xuechen!

21:05.720 --> 21:07.000
Mr. Xie,

21:07.080 --> 21:08.360
when you were unconscious just now,

21:08.440 --> 21:10.000
you called out my name.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.760
Seems like you just can't forget me.

21:13.840 --> 21:15.880
We've already left
the Two Realms Mountain.

21:15.960 --> 21:18.560
I concealed our presence along the way.
No one was following us.

21:19.320 --> 21:21.120
Here, it's just the two of us.

21:22.160 --> 21:23.560
You could shout yourself hoarse,

21:23.640 --> 21:25.520
and no one would come.

21:30.400 --> 21:31.280
Why did you save me?

21:32.240 --> 21:33.160
What exactly are you after?

21:33.760 --> 21:34.800
Naturally, it's you.

21:36.120 --> 21:37.320
At first glance in the Lava,

21:37.840 --> 21:39.640
I fell in love with you.

21:40.520 --> 21:42.600
So, I offered the rarest spiritual essence
to help you escape.

21:43.640 --> 21:45.320
I thought an hour would be enough for you

21:45.400 --> 21:46.880
to leave the Dark Abyss.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.920
Who would've thought
you'd act so recklessly,

21:50.600 --> 21:52.280
charging straight into
the Temple of Divine Execution.

21:52.360 --> 21:53.840
I had no choice.

21:53.920 --> 21:56.480
I had to play along as your hostage.

21:59.520 --> 22:02.480
For you, I've practically betrayed
my master and ancestors.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.760
The Dark Abyss is no longer
an option for me.

22:06.400 --> 22:08.840
From now on, wherever you go…

22:12.680 --> 22:13.640
I'll follow.

22:16.840 --> 22:18.320
As the Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

22:19.280 --> 22:20.440
how could you betray Sang Qi?

22:20.520 --> 22:22.400
We always act on our own desires,

22:23.120 --> 22:23.960
not on morality.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.040
What is there to betray?

22:30.920 --> 22:32.000
You don't believe me?

22:32.960 --> 22:35.760
Then let me tell you Sang Qi's plan.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.280
He's collaborating with humans

22:41.360 --> 22:43.000
to obtain the Chaos Pearl.

22:43.080 --> 22:44.400
You are the son
of the Immortal Alliance Leader

22:44.480 --> 22:46.520
and the Young Lord of Snow City.

22:47.240 --> 22:49.000
He imprisoned and tortured you in the Lava

22:49.720 --> 22:52.240
just to wait until you were
on the brink of despair,

22:52.320 --> 22:53.960
so you'd reveal everything to him.

22:59.160 --> 23:01.200
I said he's collaborating with humans.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.080
Why aren't you surprised at all?

23:04.320 --> 23:06.880
Do you know within the Immortal Alliance…

23:06.960 --> 23:08.320
There's a traitor.

23:11.280 --> 23:12.840
So, you already know.

23:14.080 --> 23:15.240
Indeed.

23:15.760 --> 23:18.240
The cracks in the Array needed repairing.

23:18.320 --> 23:20.240
That's something widely known,
not a secret.

23:21.520 --> 23:24.320
But the exact time for entering the array

23:24.400 --> 23:26.400
was only known by the Immortal Alliance.

23:27.120 --> 23:30.240
The timing of Sang Qi's ambush
was too perfect.

23:31.000 --> 23:32.440
You're so clever,

23:32.520 --> 23:33.880
so you must have figured it out.

23:36.080 --> 23:39.200
In fact, that day, if you had abandoned
repairing the barrier,

23:39.880 --> 23:41.480
you could've escaped unharmed.

23:42.080 --> 23:43.120
If the barrier broke, so be it.

23:44.080 --> 23:46.920
Just let the Dark Clan
invade the human realm.

23:47.920 --> 23:49.280
Is it really worth
risking your life to protect it?

23:50.760 --> 23:51.920
You people from the Dark Abyss

23:52.960 --> 23:54.640
could never understand
the way of the sword cultivator.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.680
Who is Sang Qi collaborating with?

24:01.080 --> 24:02.520
I don't know.

24:04.920 --> 24:07.200
I really don't know.
There's no need to lie to you.

24:07.880 --> 24:11.280
The five Alliance tokens are guarded
by the leaders of the five sects.

24:11.360 --> 24:13.240
Having only the one from Snow City

24:13.320 --> 24:14.160
is useless on its own.

24:14.760 --> 24:17.480
So, I guess Sang Qi
must have another plan.

24:19.600 --> 24:20.440
You see,

24:21.480 --> 24:22.800
I've never held back

24:22.880 --> 24:24.320
when it comes to the people I like.

24:25.040 --> 24:26.600
Whether it should be said or not,

24:27.200 --> 24:28.640
I've told you everything.

24:31.720 --> 24:34.600
This woman's words are half-truths
and must not be fully trusted.

24:41.360 --> 24:42.200
The wounds on my body…

24:42.280 --> 24:43.960
Of course, I treated them for you

24:44.040 --> 24:45.240
and changed your clothes.

24:46.120 --> 24:47.440
Mr. Xie,

24:47.520 --> 24:49.080
you truly are magnificent
and extraordinary,

24:49.160 --> 24:50.160
blessed with natural talent.

24:59.680 --> 25:00.800
Let go of me!

25:04.600 --> 25:05.440
Let go of me!

25:07.400 --> 25:09.920
You've lost your spiritual power,
while I have demonic power.

25:10.520 --> 25:12.360
Knowing you can't win,
you still fight back.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.840
Are you playing hard to get?

25:15.480 --> 25:17.520
-Let go of me.
-Let go?

25:17.600 --> 25:18.960
Where should I let go?

25:21.560 --> 25:23.040
Here?

25:37.880 --> 25:39.160
Madam.

25:40.080 --> 25:41.480
Miss Mu.

25:41.560 --> 25:44.680
I just heard voices coming from your room

25:44.760 --> 25:46.800
and thought your husband had woken up.

25:46.880 --> 25:49.240
I happened to make some porridge,
so I brought it over.

25:49.320 --> 25:52.240
Thank you, Madam.
It's perfect timing. We're starving.

25:52.880 --> 25:53.840
My husband and I

25:53.920 --> 25:56.120
have really troubled you this time.

25:56.200 --> 25:57.160
No trouble at all!

25:57.240 --> 25:58.400
This is a remote place.

25:58.480 --> 26:00.600
You can recover here without worrying
about enemies catching up.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.280
I heard from my son

26:03.360 --> 26:05.160
that your husband is gravely injured.

26:05.240 --> 26:07.440
You'd better stay here
and recover fully before leaving.

26:07.520 --> 26:09.440
As it happens,
my son knows a bit of medicine

26:09.520 --> 26:11.280
and can help change his bandages.

26:12.000 --> 26:13.760
-Thank you.
-No need to thank me.

26:14.360 --> 26:16.000
-If you need anything, just call me.
-Alright.

26:19.360 --> 26:20.720
Ah, youth is such a blessing!

26:21.480 --> 26:23.520
Stop peeking! What
are you peeking at? Off you go!

26:30.080 --> 26:31.200
Alright.

26:31.280 --> 26:32.320
I admit I lied.

26:33.200 --> 26:34.160
I told them

26:34.240 --> 26:36.160
we're a runaway couple.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.520
I'm the daughter of a wealthy family,

26:38.360 --> 26:40.400
and you're a down-and-out swordsman.

26:40.480 --> 26:42.480
My family disapproved of our marriage

26:42.560 --> 26:44.280
and sent people to hunt you down.

26:44.360 --> 26:45.880
That's why they took us in.

26:46.840 --> 26:49.120
Hubby, do we even look

26:49.200 --> 26:50.400
like a couple?

26:53.640 --> 26:54.680
The one who treated my injuries

26:54.760 --> 26:56.120
was the madam's son.

26:58.280 --> 26:59.560
Yes.

27:00.120 --> 27:02.480
I admit I didn't see your majestic body

27:02.560 --> 27:04.480
or help with your injuries.

27:04.560 --> 27:06.440
And your clothes
were also changed by him, Mr. Hou,

27:06.520 --> 27:07.960
at my request.

27:08.040 --> 27:08.880
The Dark Clan is inherently malicious,

27:09.960 --> 27:11.440
and the Spirit Clan are the best liars.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.280
But there's one thing I said that's true.

27:16.920 --> 27:18.120
Which is?

27:18.720 --> 27:19.680
That I like you.

27:26.600 --> 27:28.320
Now your body is injured,

27:28.400 --> 27:29.440
your spiritual form is damaged,

27:29.520 --> 27:30.840
and you're no different from a mortal.

27:31.680 --> 27:34.440
Eating grains
can help restore your vitality.

27:37.720 --> 27:39.200
The sooner you recover,

27:39.280 --> 27:40.560
the sooner you can get rid of me, right?

27:45.440 --> 27:47.400
Aren't you afraid I poisoned the porridge?

27:56.080 --> 27:57.280
If you wanted to harm me,

27:58.080 --> 27:59.080
why would you save me?

28:01.520 --> 28:02.640
I didn't poison it,

28:03.880 --> 28:05.360
-but I did add something.
-You…

28:06.000 --> 28:08.440
Relax. It's a tonic.

28:09.040 --> 28:10.360
Get some proper rest.

28:10.440 --> 28:11.960
It'll be good for your body.

28:26.600 --> 28:29.040
Stealing, are you? Not working, huh?

28:29.720 --> 28:30.880
I'll beat you to death!

28:41.000 --> 28:42.200
Do you want to come with me?

28:43.720 --> 28:45.000
I'm a spirit slave.

28:45.840 --> 28:48.760
I must follow the steward's orders.

28:48.840 --> 28:50.560
You're no spirit slave.

28:53.640 --> 28:55.760
Why are you so kind to me?

28:56.560 --> 28:57.680
I just want you to be happy.

28:59.080 --> 29:01.000
Could it be…

29:01.080 --> 29:03.800
that you are my long-lost father? Father!

29:05.280 --> 29:06.160
Don't call me father!

29:07.200 --> 29:09.840
You won't even tell me your name.

29:10.880 --> 29:12.120
What should I call you, then?

29:12.200 --> 29:13.800
Just don't call me father.

29:13.880 --> 29:14.720
Then…

29:17.200 --> 29:18.640
How about Big Brother?

29:19.360 --> 29:20.280
Big Brother!

29:22.560 --> 29:23.840
Don't be afraid.

29:24.560 --> 29:25.920
Close your eyes.

29:26.600 --> 29:28.280
When you open them again,

29:28.360 --> 29:29.640
everything will be fine.

29:32.280 --> 29:33.960
Good girl. Listen to me.

29:34.600 --> 29:35.440
Quickly…

29:35.520 --> 29:37.080
Quickly unlock the Spirit Lock…

29:37.160 --> 29:38.800
Sang… Sang Qi…

29:39.320 --> 29:40.480
Sang Qi is coming…

29:41.000 --> 29:42.040
Quickly…

29:43.320 --> 29:45.040
Big Brother!

29:47.480 --> 29:48.600
Is it really you?

29:50.320 --> 29:51.240
But…

29:52.000 --> 29:53.440
you're supposed to be dead.

30:00.520 --> 30:03.680
VOID SEA

30:04.960 --> 30:06.760
In this world,

30:06.840 --> 30:09.080
if people give rise to greed,
anger, or ignorance,

30:09.160 --> 30:11.360
inner demons will emerge.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.800
The aura of these inner demons

30:12.880 --> 30:14.840
gathers in the Void Sea

30:14.920 --> 30:16.160
and forms the Dark Clan…

30:16.240 --> 30:17.080
DESIRE DEMON

30:17.160 --> 30:18.160
…creatures with no blood, no flesh,

30:18.760 --> 30:20.320
and no weaknesses.

30:20.400 --> 30:22.680
Even if shattered to dust,

30:23.280 --> 30:26.560
we will eventually return
to the Void Sea and be reborn.

30:26.640 --> 30:29.760
Humans' attempt to wipe out the Dark Clan

30:29.840 --> 30:31.360
is pure wishful thinking!

30:32.320 --> 30:34.720
But wishful thinking itself
is also an obsession

30:35.240 --> 30:36.800
that can give birth to inner demons.

30:37.720 --> 30:39.080
That's my favorite part.

30:41.240 --> 30:43.760
Anger Demon. Why aren't you speaking?

30:45.880 --> 30:47.480
I think…

30:47.560 --> 30:48.920
Based on my judgment,

30:49.000 --> 30:50.120
the Saintess

30:50.200 --> 30:51.800
must have eloped with Xie Xuechen!

30:51.880 --> 30:53.000
Right.

30:54.400 --> 30:55.600
Ridiculous.

30:55.680 --> 30:56.720
Elope?

30:57.720 --> 31:00.000
Don't you know

31:00.080 --> 31:01.520
what kind of person the Saintess is?

31:02.200 --> 31:04.360
She's nothing but sugar-coated poison.

31:04.960 --> 31:07.280
She'll flatter you on the surface,

31:07.360 --> 31:08.960
then stab you in the back.

31:09.040 --> 31:10.840
When has she ever been sincere?

31:11.480 --> 31:12.880
I bet this time too,

31:12.960 --> 31:14.560
she's plotting something in her heart.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.240
Enough.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.440
His Grace ordered us
to set up the Demon Array.

31:19.080 --> 31:19.920
Let's begin.

31:27.280 --> 31:29.040
Wherever there are inner demons,

31:29.960 --> 31:32.000
they'll serve as our eyes.

31:32.760 --> 31:34.280
Without setting up
the array, we didn't realize

31:34.360 --> 31:35.960
how many inner demons

31:36.040 --> 31:37.360
were spreading in the world these days.

31:37.440 --> 31:39.920
Humans are never satisfied.

31:40.000 --> 31:41.320
Their greed knows no bounds.

31:41.400 --> 31:43.000
This Demon Array

31:43.080 --> 31:44.920
will help us find them.

32:02.640 --> 32:04.560
-You're hurting me again!
-Why are you here again?

32:08.200 --> 32:10.040
We're married.

32:10.120 --> 32:12.160
Doesn't that just mean sharing a bed?

32:12.240 --> 32:14.560
We could be anything

32:15.080 --> 32:16.160
but never a married couple.

32:18.360 --> 32:19.600
Alright.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.680
You sleep here. I'll find another spot.

32:26.560 --> 32:28.000
Mr. Xie,

32:28.640 --> 32:30.120
be reasonable!

32:32.200 --> 32:33.240
Let go!

32:34.000 --> 32:36.040
Do you think you can beat me now?

32:43.440 --> 32:46.360
If I really wanted to do something to you,
could you stop me?

32:49.960 --> 32:51.800
Be good. Lie down and rest.

33:01.520 --> 33:02.840
-I know
-No anger…

33:02.920 --> 33:05.640
the way of sword cultivators,
straight, unyielding.

33:05.720 --> 33:06.880
-No anger…
-Brave, ever forward.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.920
-You were born extraordinary.
-Be calm…

33:09.000 --> 33:11.080
-You've never faced such humiliation.
-No anger…

33:11.600 --> 33:12.960
-If you submit,
-No anger…

33:13.040 --> 33:13.960
it may unsettle your faith.

33:14.560 --> 33:15.800
If you resist to the death,

33:15.880 --> 33:17.160
your dignity might be tarnished.

33:17.240 --> 33:20.680
And in the end, I'd still say
you were playing hard to get,

33:20.760 --> 33:21.880
even more humiliating.

33:22.720 --> 33:23.880
Am I right?

33:29.200 --> 33:30.400
Rest assured,

33:31.120 --> 33:32.800
I won't lay a finger on you.

33:59.440 --> 34:00.360
If I were you,

34:00.440 --> 34:02.360
I wouldn't return to Snow City now.

34:03.080 --> 34:04.680
Whoever leaked your deployment

34:04.760 --> 34:06.920
must hold a high position
in the Immortal Alliance.

34:08.600 --> 34:11.520
With your powers gone,
if you run into them,

34:11.600 --> 34:13.120
you'd stand no chance.

34:13.199 --> 34:16.000
They'd undoubtedly try to kill you.

34:16.080 --> 34:17.199
Xie Xuechen.

34:17.280 --> 34:18.800
Xie Xuechen!

34:20.480 --> 34:21.360
What exactly are you planning?

34:22.040 --> 34:23.159
Do I need to tell you

34:23.760 --> 34:25.120
what I'm planning?

34:25.199 --> 34:27.600
But you, whatever you're scheming,

34:28.280 --> 34:29.920
I suggest you stop following me.

34:31.560 --> 34:33.639
I know you don't want to travel with me.

34:33.719 --> 34:36.719
But… can you stop me from following you?

34:37.560 --> 34:38.800
I already said

34:39.600 --> 34:41.920
wherever you go, I'll follow.

34:42.520 --> 34:43.840
I never agreed to this.

34:45.400 --> 34:47.360
Mr. Xie, you seem to have forgotten

34:48.239 --> 34:49.719
I'm the Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

34:50.239 --> 34:51.280
a villain.

34:52.320 --> 34:54.120
I don't need your agreement.

34:54.199 --> 34:56.440
I know you don't fear death,

34:56.520 --> 34:58.640
but you care about the world,

34:58.720 --> 35:00.000
and you want to protect humanity.

35:00.840 --> 35:02.320
As long as I'm willing,

35:02.840 --> 35:04.760
the whole world becomes my hostage.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.520
Back in the Dark Abyss,

35:09.560 --> 35:10.560
I should've killed you.

35:10.640 --> 35:12.280
But you missed your chance.

35:12.360 --> 35:15.000
Now, you're at my mercy.

35:16.600 --> 35:17.880
Miss Mu!

35:20.240 --> 35:21.480
Mr. Hou.

35:25.360 --> 35:27.640
-Miss Mu.
-Mr. Hou.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.240
Thank you for saving us.

35:29.320 --> 35:31.760
I'll repay this debt in the future.

35:33.440 --> 35:34.440
No need for that.

35:34.520 --> 35:35.960
Miss Mu, this place

35:36.560 --> 35:38.480
mostly breeds small ponies.

35:38.560 --> 35:40.600
There's only one fine steed
that can travel hundreds of li a day.

35:41.200 --> 35:42.360
I bought it for you.

35:42.960 --> 35:44.240
But I told the merchant

35:44.760 --> 35:45.760
to let me know

35:45.840 --> 35:47.000
if he gets more good horses.

35:47.520 --> 35:48.400
If you're not in a hurry,

35:49.160 --> 35:50.120
you can wait and stay

35:50.920 --> 35:51.760
a few more days.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.520
Hubby,

35:55.600 --> 35:56.760
what do you think?

36:04.480 --> 36:05.880
Since we're eloping,

36:05.960 --> 36:06.840
we might be pursued.

36:06.920 --> 36:09.320
I'm afraid we'll bring trouble
to Mr. Hou and the madam.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.400
So, we can't stay long.

36:11.040 --> 36:12.640
There's only one horse,

36:12.720 --> 36:14.120
but it'll do.

36:14.200 --> 36:16.600
Mr. Hou, thank you for your efforts.

36:17.280 --> 36:19.520
No need to thank me.
It was just a small gesture.

36:20.480 --> 36:22.480
But today, I asked around at the market.

36:22.560 --> 36:25.400
There's no news
of any martial artists nearby.

36:25.480 --> 36:27.840
Our Qingshan Market rarely sees outsiders.

36:27.920 --> 36:30.400
If any martial artists came,
someone would've known about it.

36:32.120 --> 36:33.640
Miss Mu,

36:33.720 --> 36:36.960
your family probably
doesn't know you're here.

36:37.960 --> 36:40.160
You can relax.
There's no need to rush off.

36:40.240 --> 36:41.640
Staying a few more days wouldn't hurt.

36:43.400 --> 36:45.200
If my husband says we should leave,

36:45.280 --> 36:47.680
then, of course, I'll follow his lead.

36:49.640 --> 36:50.600
Mr. Hou,

36:51.200 --> 36:53.240
we have no gold or silver.

36:53.320 --> 36:55.200
Take this hairpin
as a small token of gratitude.

36:55.280 --> 36:56.960
-Thank you for your trouble.
-Oh…

36:57.680 --> 36:59.040
This is too much!

37:01.080 --> 37:02.320
Just take it on the madam's behalf.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.280
Thank her for me.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.240
Miss Mu…

37:26.120 --> 37:27.200
We've found you.

37:27.800 --> 37:28.720
Desire Demon!

37:47.480 --> 37:49.320
You set up the Demon Array.

37:50.040 --> 37:51.680
This Mr. Hou of yours

37:51.760 --> 37:53.520
has developed a desire for you.

37:53.600 --> 37:55.200
Knowing it's out of reach,

37:55.280 --> 37:57.120
yet unwilling to let go,

37:57.200 --> 37:59.960
this has given birth to an inner demon.

38:00.640 --> 38:04.000
And once there's an inner demon,
it can be controlled.

38:05.880 --> 38:09.240
So, are you blaming me
for being too charming?

38:10.120 --> 38:11.400
But…

38:12.760 --> 38:13.960
How did you get out?

38:14.040 --> 38:15.320
She's using the Illusion Elixir.

38:16.040 --> 38:16.880
This isn't her true form.

38:18.720 --> 38:19.720
It's a projection.

38:25.480 --> 38:27.360
During the battle at the Immortals Array,

38:27.880 --> 38:29.240
we were so focused on fighting

38:29.320 --> 38:31.320
that we didn't get a good look

38:31.400 --> 38:33.600
at Mr. Xie's appearance.

38:33.680 --> 38:34.960
Now that I see you today,

38:35.040 --> 38:36.800
Anger Demon was right,

38:36.880 --> 38:38.320
and you are quite good-looking.

38:39.520 --> 38:40.880
Fighting is exhausting.

38:41.480 --> 38:42.880
Be good and come back
to the Dark Abyss with me.

38:45.880 --> 38:47.120
He's mine.

38:49.200 --> 38:50.560
Oh, really?

39:03.760 --> 39:05.040
This is bad.

39:05.120 --> 39:06.480
It's Desire Demon's Cage of Greed.

39:15.000 --> 39:16.040
Though Desire Demon isn't
as skilled in combat as Anger Demon,

39:16.920 --> 39:17.880
she's extremely troublesome.

39:18.600 --> 39:19.760
This Cage of Greed

39:19.840 --> 39:21.480
traps people in their desires,

39:21.560 --> 39:23.080
leading them to die in bliss.

39:23.600 --> 39:25.680
Xie Xuechen, you… Be careful!

39:31.640 --> 39:32.600
Xie Xuechen,

39:33.200 --> 39:34.600
my chest hurts so much…

39:34.680 --> 39:36.160
Can you check it for me?

39:41.600 --> 39:43.240
You truly live up to the name

39:43.320 --> 39:45.120
of the strongest
sword cultivator in the world.

39:47.760 --> 39:48.920
What's wrong?

39:49.640 --> 39:52.440
Did I fail to imitate
the Saintess convincingly?

39:53.080 --> 39:54.520
Or do you simply dislike her?

39:57.040 --> 39:58.480
The Dark Clan has no heartbeat.

39:59.520 --> 40:01.720
The one who was struck by the arrow
was indeed Mu Xuanling.

40:01.800 --> 40:03.400
But at the moment she fell,

40:04.400 --> 40:05.680
it was already you.

40:06.520 --> 40:08.040
I was careless.

40:08.640 --> 40:10.560
I forgot that you have

40:10.640 --> 40:12.080
extraordinary perception.

40:12.160 --> 40:14.440
Just relying on this substitution trick

40:14.520 --> 40:16.360
can't fool you.

40:17.280 --> 40:18.160
Had I known earlier,

40:18.920 --> 40:20.480
I would've taken
a human heart to use instead.

40:21.160 --> 40:22.440
Such a misstep!

40:23.160 --> 40:24.800
The hardest thing for people to overcome

40:24.880 --> 40:26.800
is their own desires.

40:27.480 --> 40:30.240
No matter how strong you are,
you won't escape.

40:33.800 --> 40:35.760
Mr. Xie,

40:35.840 --> 40:37.920
before you die,

40:38.000 --> 40:41.880
enjoy this worldly bliss.

40:41.960 --> 40:43.160
Meow, where are you?

40:43.920 --> 40:45.000
Meow!

40:53.560 --> 40:54.880
Where is Xie Xuechen?

40:54.960 --> 40:57.120
The Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

40:57.200 --> 40:59.440
throwing herself in front
of an arrow for a man?

41:00.160 --> 41:01.680
You protect him so much.

41:02.280 --> 41:05.040
Could it be that Anger Demon was right?

41:05.960 --> 41:08.280
Have you really fallen for Xie Xuechen

41:09.240 --> 41:10.600
and plan to betray the Dark Abyss?

41:17.720 --> 41:18.600
What do you think?

41:18.680 --> 41:20.720
I think it's unlike you.

41:20.800 --> 41:23.200
That's why I'm standing here
talking to you.

41:24.280 --> 41:28.800
Otherwise, I would've already taken
both of your heads back

41:28.880 --> 41:30.480
to report to His Grace.

41:34.360 --> 41:36.200
Report to Master?

41:37.960 --> 41:41.080
Why don't you use that brain
that you hardly ever use?

41:41.160 --> 41:42.960
If Master hadn't allowed it,

41:43.040 --> 41:45.920
how could I so easily
take Xie Xuechen out of the Dark Abyss?

41:49.000 --> 41:50.320
What do you mean?

41:50.400 --> 41:53.040
How do you think Xie Xuechen
escaped the Lava Execution Ground?

41:55.040 --> 41:56.840
Naturally, someone helped him.

42:00.320 --> 42:03.320
The Lava is guarded
by 18 layers of restrictions.

42:04.320 --> 42:06.560
How could you possibly
have the ability to break them?

42:06.640 --> 42:08.840
I don't have that ability.

42:08.920 --> 42:10.520
It was Xie Xuechen himself who broke them.

42:11.720 --> 42:12.680
I merely

42:12.760 --> 42:16.280
gave him an elixir
to restore his strength.

42:17.960 --> 42:19.000
Think about it.

42:19.840 --> 42:21.360
How could I obtain

42:21.960 --> 42:23.160
such a rare elixir?

42:30.960 --> 42:32.520
It was given to you by His Grace?

42:33.120 --> 42:35.440
Master instructed me to let him go.

42:36.240 --> 42:37.760
That way,

42:37.840 --> 42:39.480
I'd owe him his life,

42:39.560 --> 42:41.520
allowing me to stay by his side

42:42.520 --> 42:44.760
and wait for the chance
to seize the tokens.
